{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"絶賛全身筋肉痛です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2015/04/18/5631738/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"折り返し地点にきました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"サイリウムやうちわ、タオル\n見えるとそれだけでやる気が\nでるというか元気になれる(>_<)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございます"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ライブが終わって家に帰って\n家で復習予習をして\nお風呂はいって毎回2時過ぎに寝るって\nいう生活を送っています。汗"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2015/04/18/5631738/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"このアプリおもしろーいって\n言いながら撮ってくれました。\nふざけました（＾∇＾）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この時なぜかずっと私大爆笑してて\nおかしかったみたいです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2015/04/18/5631738/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この時握手会終わりだから\nほぼメイクしてなくて\nナチュラルな状態。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ナチュラルな自然な感じの好き！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ホテル1人部屋だったから少し\n怖い表情してる。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今度ゆっくり出来る時間があれば\n絢音ちゃんとディズニー行く約束\nしてるんだー♪\n私も絢音ちゃんも絶叫系乗れないから\n雰囲気を楽しみに行きます。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しみ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2015/04/18/5631738/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私が1番好きな色は黄色だけど\nそもそも黄色ってどんな意味を\n持っているんだろうなぁって\nふと気になって調べてみたの！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎黄色◎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もっとも自然光に近い色。\n人に喜びや希望を与え、楽天的な考え方を\nもたらし社交的で楽しい気分を生み出す。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"風水でいうと、金運アップもそうだけど\n変革、変化。\nこうなりたいと思う自分になれるという\n効果があります"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんか今の私には黄色って大事！\nってすごく思いました...笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2015/04/18/5631738/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"切り替えて。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また見てね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みり愛"}],"source":"archive"}